	(text "PLL: ADF4002 locks the 32 MHz VCXO to REF_10M.\nR = 5, N = 16, PFD 2 MHz. VCXO Kv = 85 ppm/V (2.7 kHz/V).\nLoop filter: ICP 2.5 mA gives about 250 Hz loop\nbandwidth and 65 deg phase margin.\nICP 0.625 mA to 5 mA gives 70 Hz to 450 Hz.\nRFIN: 470R and 49R9 reduce the 3.3 V CMOS\nsignal to about -7 dBm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0b7be9bb-c964-4396-930a-65c6564800c8")
	)
